  "description": "Ochoco: The Perfect Touring Bike for Smaller Riders\nThe Ochoco redefines what a compact touring bike can be, offering incredible stability and load-carrying capability in a smaller, more accessible frame. Designed specifically for shorter riders or those seeking a more upright fit with a shorter reach, the Ochoco offers the same high-quality performance as our larger touring bikes, with a focus on fit and comfort.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 650b Wheels: Compatible with 30mm–40mm tires for a smooth, stable ride on mixed-terrain roads and gravel.\n\nDouble-Butted and Heat-Treated Cromoly Tubing: Lightweight and durable, built to withstand long-distance touring with strength and comfort.\n\nSteel Uni-Crown Touring Fork: Provides excellent stability and handling, even with a fully-loaded bike.\n\nThru-Axles for Increased Stability: 142x12mm rear and 100x12mm front thru-axles ensure precise handling, even when carrying heavy loads.\n\nProven Co-Motion Touring Geometry: Designed for comfort and control, ideal for long rides with a focus on ergonomic fit.\n\nRack, Fender, and Bottle Mounts: Equipped with the braze-ons to carry your touring gear, with three bottle mounts to keep you hydrated on the go.\n\nMechanical Disc Brakes and Hand-Built Touring Wheels: Reliable stopping power and rugged wheels, perfect for handling diverse terrain and weight distribution.\n\nThe Ochoco is the perfect choice for smaller riders who don’t want to compromise on performance or comfort. Whether you're touring near or far, this bike delivers a smooth, stable ride and exceptional load-carrying ability in a package tailored just for you.\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Ochoco order started!",
